00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:07.780
- [Haolong] Hello, Gary! 
 I'm Haolong.
.

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:11.080
I'm so glad that I 
can have the chance to

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:12.940
